. Title
Gift Card and Voucher Management System
2. Domain
E-Commerce / Digital Payment and Customer Management
3. Who is the User?
The system has three main types of users:
Admin: Manages users, gift cards, vouchers, and transactions.
Customer: Purchases, views, and redeems gift cards and vouchers.
Merchant: Verifies gift cards and vouchers and processes redemptions.
4. What Problem Are We Solving?
Managing gift cards and vouchers manually can lead to problems such as difficulty in tracking balances, expiry dates, and transactions. Customers may not know whether a voucher is valid, expired, or already used. Administrators may also find it difficult to manage all gift cards, vouchers, users, and transactions in one place. This system provides a centralized digital platform to manage gift cards and vouchers efficiently.
5. Proposed Solution
The application will provide the following features:
Admin can create and manage gift cards and vouchers.
The system generates a unique code for each gift card or voucher.
Customers can purchase gift cards and vouchers.
Customers can view their available balance and transaction history.
Customers can check the validity and expiry date of vouchers.
The system validates gift cards and vouchers before redemption.
Expired or already-used vouchers cannot be redeemed.
Merchants can verify gift card and voucher codes.
Admin can manage users, gift cards, vouchers, and transactions.
