Merchant
Verify gift cards/vouchers and process customer redemptions
8. Success Criteria
The system will be considered successful when:
A customer can purchase a gift card or voucher within 1 minute.
The system generates a unique code for every gift card and voucher.
Customers can easily view their balance and transaction history.
Expired vouchers cannot be redeemed.
Already-redeemed vouchers cannot be used again.
Merchants can quickly verify voucher and gift card validity.
Admin can easily monitor and manage all transactions.
9. Out of Scope
The following features will not be included in the initial version:
Real bank or payment gateway integration
International currency conversion
Real-time delivery tracking
AI-based recommendation systems
Advanced fraud detection
Mobile application development
Integration with external shopping platforms
The main focus of this project is the management, validation, purchase, and redemption of gift cards and vouchers.
